  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a juxtaposition of text and image to create a harmful stereotype. The text claims that 'gay guys never get messages from foreigners' because 'they'll get stoned,' implying that gay men are somehow undesirable or unwelcome to foreigners. The image of a man wearing a traditional Islamic head covering (kufi) is used to visually represent the 'foreigner' in this context. This creates a hateful and offensive implication that gay men are somehow 'stoned' or undesirable to foreigners, which is a harmful and inaccurate stereotype. The meme relies on the visual of the man to reinforce the stereotype that foreigners are somehow 'stoned' or unwelcome to gay men, which is a harmful and inaccurate stereotype. The meme is hateful because it targets gay men and foreigners with a derogatory and inaccurate stereotype, which is a form of hate speech.",
